{
  "layout": "ozl_node_neutral",
  "note": "One node of the neutral window («Записник сталкера»): a clean paper card 176x64 lying in a 216x104 cell from (20, 20), so the card's centre is (108, 52) -- the skin's AnchorX/AnchorY; the menu places the cell at the node's point minus that. NodeShape is the card picture with 12 units of room for its shadow; slots 0..2 (plain, hovered, locked) are loaded by the menu from OZL_TreeSkin_Neutral.Shapes and tinted by status. NodeRing (blue ring of an available node) and NodeSel (red dashed ring of the selected one) are drawn round the card, 8 units out. Name in two lines, price line (chips placed by the menu from ozl_neutral_price_chip, or NodePriceText for 'Досліджено' / 'Лишилось m:ss'), the dashed progress line under the card while researching, and the mark above the right corner: a green tick (NodeMark), 'в ділі' (NodeMarkText), or a small '?' for a locked node (NodeMarkQuery). NodeHit is the style-less button UNDER the card: the menu renames it node:<id>. Every other widget ignores the pointer (containers are transparent panels for that: a frame takes the pointer), except NodeBody, which holds NodeHit and so lies under it.",
